# Check text files out with LF everywhere, Windows included.
#
# plugins/*/server/index.js is committed build output, and CI rebuilds it on
# Linux and fails when the two differ. With core.autocrlf=true and no
# attributes, a Windows checkout turned the sources and the committed bundle
# CRLF while vite writes LF, so a rebuild that matched the commit byte for byte
# still showed as modified. LF on every checkout makes the local rebuild the
# same file CI builds.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary

# Built output: collapsed in GitHub's diffs, left out of language stats.
plugins/*/server/index.js linguist-generated=true
